==History==
2023
*The Royal Recruits' Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 4/9/2023, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/9/2023)|September 2023 Update]].
*On 13/11/2023, a [[Version History#Minor Update (13/11/2023)|Minor Update]], decreased the Evolved Royal Recruits' damage to 106% of the original's (from 112%).
2024
*On 3/1/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/1/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Royal Recruits' charge damage by 8%.
*On 5/3/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], removed the Evolved Royal Recruits’ damage boost.
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Royal Recruits’ hitpoints by 3%, but removed their hitpoints boost.
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved Royal Recruits after death.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Royal Recruits' charge damage by 3% and increased the distance required for charging to 2 tiles (from 1.5 tiles).
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], made it so that Evolved Royal Recruits' spawn formation would be correctly mirrored depending on which side of the [[Arenas|Arena]] they were placed.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]], increased the distance required for charging to 2.5 tiles (from 2 tiles).

