==Trivia==
*The Royal Recruits' Evolution is tied with the [[P.E.K.K.A./Evolution|P.E.K.K.A]] and [[Mega Knight/Evolution|Mega Knight]] for the most expensive [[Card Evolution|Evolution]] to be placed, costing 14 [[Elixir]] (excluding Elixir from using other [[cards]]).
*In the Turkish, Japanese, Korean, Chinese, Persian, Indonesian, Thai, Finnish, and Vietnamese language settings of the game, the Royal Recruits' name translates to "Guards", "Apprentice Bodyguards", "Royal Trainees", "Royal Guards", "Royal Soldiers", "Royal Army", "Royal Conscripts", "The King's Warriors", and "Royal Rookies" respectively.
*The Royal Recruits' Evolution is 1 of 2 evolved cards to have an alliterative name, the other being [[Goblin Giant/Evolution|Goblin Giant]].
*The Royal Recruits' Evolution is 1 of 2 evolved troops with a charge, the other being [[Battle Ram/Evolution|Battle Ram]].
**The Royal Recruits' charge shares the same sound effects as the [[Prince]]'s and [[Raging Prince]]'s.
*The Royal Recruits' Evolution is the only evolved card that cannot be placed in the opponent's territory if only one [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] has been destroyed.
*Even though the card spawns 6 Royal Recruits, the card render displays only 1 Royal Recruit.
*The deploy sound of the Evolved Royal Recruits is identical to the one spawned by the [[Royal Delivery]].
*The Royal Recruits' Evolution is tied with the [[P.E.K.K.A./Evolution|P.E.K.K.A.]] and the [[Mega Knight/Evolution|Mega Knight]] for the most expensive [[:Category:1-Cycles Evolutions|1-Cycle]] [[Card Evolution|Evolution]], costing 7 [[Elixir]]. They are also the most expensive Evolution overall.
*The Royal Recruits' Evolution is the subject of an [[Emotes|Emote]].
**It is also 1 of 4 evolved cards whose regular card is not the subject of any Emote, the others being [[Zap/Evolution|Zap]], [[Giant Snowball/Evolution|Giant Snowball]], and Battle Ram.
*The Royal Recruits' Evolution was featured in the winning [[Battle Decks|deck]] of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/vRrgTfqRdpw?si=YDASUydL7qNm9QZz Clash Royale League 2023 Tournament], by a player called Mugi.
*The Royal Recruits' Evolution has had balance changes that were planned for it but were not added to the game. More specifically:
**The initial balance change for Evolved Royal Recruits on the [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/1/2024)|3/1/2024 balance changes]] was a removal of their damage boost, but it changed to a 6% charge damage decrease [https://royaleapi.com/blog/season-55-balance-wip last minute].
**The initial balance change for Evolved Royal Recruits on the [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|8/1/2025 balance changes]] was a 4% damage increase, a 1% charge damage increase, and a charge range increase to 2 tiles (from 1.5 tiles), but the charge damage increase was changed to a 3% decrease, and the damage increase [https://royaleapi.com/blog/season-67-balance-wip-january-2025 was pulled back last minute].

